        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "icon.ownImagePresentAfterRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "hud.visibleAfterRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": "gksr.hud.sermonDone",
          "observation": "hud.selectedTextKeyAfterRecovery"
        }
      ],
      "id": "icon-pending-suppresses-done-no-notice",
      "phaseNote": "待定阶段与恢复后阶段分开记录：待定快照使用 BeforeResolve 键，恢复后使用 AfterRecovery/AfterResolve 键，避免当前字段歧义。",
      "prerequisites": [
        "布道日当天处于 Done 状态（原生 sermon_ready < 1）且两个门槛任务均 Completed。",
        "打勾图标异步加载可受控处于待定。"
      ],
      "profileId": "local-fault-notices",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-14"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "使打勾图标加载处于待定。预期：业务状态仍为可读 Done，逻辑选定的业务键保持 Done。检查：state.readable=true 且 hud.selectedTextKeyBeforeResolve=gksr.hud.sermonDone。",
        "记录待定阶段的实际呈现。预期：整个 Done 呈现被抑制且实际 TMP 文本已清空。检查：hud.visibleBeforeResolve=false 且 hud.tmpTextClearedBeforeResolve=true。",
        "解除阻塞并记录恢复后阶段。预期：Done 与自有 Image 恢复。检查：icon.spriteLoadedAfterResolve=true 且 hud.visibleAfterRecovery=true。"
      ],
      "title": "打勾图标加载待定期间抑制 Done 呈现且不误报故障"
    },
    {
      "category": "icon-isolation",
      "evidence": {
